data/benchmarks/locomo_real/
# Per-run artifacts from scripts/compare_cross_episode.py (regenerated; curated
# snapshots are committed alongside results/cross_episode/README.md). The glob covers
# scenario-suffixed scratch dirs (_runs_lever1, _runs_lever1b, …).
results/cross_episode/_runs*/
